{% raw %}
{
  "title": "Observability Stack Infrastructure Health",
  "uid": "observability-stack-health",
  "tags": ["observability", "victoriametrics", "loki", "alloy", "tempo"],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "Appliance Overview",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/aihost-appliance-telemetry/aihost-appliance-and-gpu-telemetry"
    },
    {
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "Inference Drilldown",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/aihost-inference/aihost-inference"
    },
    {
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "Host & GPU Drilldown",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/aihost-host/aihost-host-and-gpu"
    },
    {
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "Stack Health",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/observability-stack-health/observability-stack-infrastructure-health"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 100,
      "title": "Observability Stack Overview KPIs",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "title": "Active Scrape Targets (up)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "id": 1,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(up == 1)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "VM Samples Ingestion Rate",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 1 },
      "id": 2,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(vm_rows_inserted_total[1m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "VM Storage Disk Free",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 1 },
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "vm_free_disk_space_bytes",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Loki Log Messages / s",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(loki_log_messages_total[1m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "vmalert Evaluation Rate",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 16, "y": 1 },
      "id": 5,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(vmalert_iteration_total[1m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Active Alerts Firing",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 20, "y": 1 },
      "id": 6,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "vmalert_alerts_firing or count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": 0 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 101,
      "title": "Alloy Scrape & Ingestion Pipeline",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "title": "Scrape Targets Status (up)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 7,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "up",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} - {{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "mappings": [
            { "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green" } }, "type": "value" }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Alloy Remote-Write Throughput & Failures",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "id": 8,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(prometheus_remote_storage_samples_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "Sent samples/s",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(prometheus_remote_storage_samples_failed_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "Failed samples/s",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "id": 102,
      "title": "VictoriaMetrics Storage & Query Health",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "title": "VictoriaMetrics Ingestion Rate over Time",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "id": 9,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(vm_rows_inserted_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "Rows/sec",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "VictoriaMetrics HTTP Queries & Errors",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 15 },
      "id": 10,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(vm_http_requests_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "HTTP queries/s",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(vm_http_request_errors_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "HTTP errors/s",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 23 },
      "id": 103,
      "title": "Tempo Distributed Tracing & Service Graph",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "title": "Tempo Traces Created / Spans Accepted (Fixed Query)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "id": 11,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(tempo_receiver_accepted_spans[1m]) or rate(tempo_live_store_traces_created_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "Traces / Spans Accepted",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Service Graph Request Flow",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 24 },
      "id": 12,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (client, server) (traces_service_graph_request_total)",
          "legendFormat": "{{client}} -> {{server}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 32 },
      "id": 104,
      "title": "Architecture Scope Boundaries & Alert Delivery",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "title": "Tracing Scope Boundary Notice",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 33 },
      "id": 13,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Tracing Pipeline Status & Explicit Scope Boundary\n\n- **Backend Pipeline Verified**: Grafana Alloy OTLP receiver (`:4317` gRPC, `:4318` HTTP), Tempo storage engine (`:3200`), and VictoriaMetrics service-graph metrics-generator are fully functioning and verified.\n- **Scope Boundary**: Native in-process tracing instrumentation across Nexus, orchestrator gateway, and llama.cpp workers remains an unproven boundary.\n- **Notice**: Do NOT interpret synthetic or pipeline demonstration spans as measured production inference execution. Native worker instrumentation is separate scoped development."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Alerting & Notification Delivery Path",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 33 },
      "id": 14,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Alerting Verification & Notification Delivery\n\n- **Rule Evaluation**: Recording and alert rules are actively evaluated inside `vmalert` every 15 seconds against live VictoriaMetrics telemetry.\n- **Notification Path**: Alerts fire within `vmalert` and are recorded in TSDB as `ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"}`.\n- **Notification Delivery Sink**: The notification delivery sink is intentionally routed to local audit logs/endpoints without active external paging to protect production environments from spurious pages during benchmarking sweeps."
      }
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 39 },
      "id": 105,
      "title": "Logs & Trace Correlation (Loki)",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "title": "Observability Stack & Ingress Logs",
      "type": "logs",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 40 },
      "id": 15,
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{job=~\"systemd-journal|nexus-client\"}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endraw %}
